No third-party code is included in this repository. The nodes call these installed libraries:
- sentence-transformers (Apache License 2.0)
- Hugging Face Transformers (Apache License 2.0), which implements EmbeddingGemma 2
- SciPy (BSD 3-Clause), for resampling audio to 16 kHz

Model (not included)
--------------------
No model weights are included or downloaded by the nodes. tools/download_model.py fetches, when you run it, google/embeddinggemma-2
at a pinned revision. Its model card states the Apache License 2.0 and says that deployments must adhere to the Gemma Prohibited Use
Policy (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy). Read both before you use the model.

